think maybe they'll change their tune on going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:48.960
it alone and separating from federally managed&nbsp;
power grids. Maybe they would change their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:54.800
tune on climate change. Doesn't really mean&nbsp;
anything, because as climate science predicts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:00.160
you have a radically hot and a radically cold&nbsp;
